# If Dance changes controllers in response to its upkeep ability, the old controller cannot sacrifice it (CR 701.21a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Valley Floodcaller
Black Lotus x2
Mox Sapphire x2
Dance of Many
Harmless Offering
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus#1.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire#1.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Valley Floodcaller.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
